From 2f54720c3a01dcef32c166fd9754b45e067dff53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philippe Cornu <philippe.cornu@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 14:14:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpu: vivante,gc: add more properties

On STM32MPx, the gpu uses the following optional extra property:
* contiguous-area: gpu-dedicated memory area.

On STM32MP2, the gpu uses following optional extra properties:
* power-domains: the platform uses more than a single power domain.
* power-domain-names: power domain names are required for "perf"
  and scmi_devpd supports.
* access-controllers: in case some firewall configuration needs
  to be checked before accessing it.

Change-Id: Icb094e8c65a10c3a57b001dd50b51680a07feda8
Signed-off-by: Philippe Cornu <philippe.cornu@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/564753
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/vivante,gc.yaml | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/vivante,gc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/vivante,gc.yaml
index b1b10ea70ad9..49bc6287dd99 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/vivante,gc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/vivante,gc.yaml
@@ -47,8 +47,19 @@ properties:
     maxItems: 1
 
   power-domains:
+    minItems: 1
+    maxItems: 3
+
+  power-domain-names:
+    minItems: 1
+    maxItems: 3
+
+  access-controllers:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  contiguous-area:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
-- 
